note Exercism-style exercise "darts": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/darts
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note score is the points of a dart landing at (x, y): 10 inside or on the circle of radius 1 around
note the centre, 5 within radius 5, 1 within radius 10, 0 outside.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/darts
om2
fn score x f64 y f64 to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
